        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 3 Bed / 3 Bath Mid-Terrace House to the letting market, located at Belfry Place, Citywest, Dublin 24. Belfry Place is one of Dublin 24's most sought-after developments and is it any wonder why? Situated in the heart of Citywest, it is just 15 minutes' walk to the Red Line LUAS & Citywest Shopping Centre, 15 minutes' drive to The Square, and 10 minutes' drive to Tallaght Hospital. It has every amenity on its doorstep and is easily accessible to the M50, N7 and N81 road networks. \r\n\r\nThe property is spacious throughout and comprises of an entranceway, a downstairs bathroom, a fully fitted kitchen, and an open living area with access to a private garden. Upstairs there are three bedrooms one single, two double, and two more bathrooms including one ensuite. This home is perfect for a wide range of tenants so please get in touch today if you are interested! \r\n\r\nFeatures: 1. 2 x Double Bedrooms 2. 1 x Single Bedroom 3. 3 x Bathrooms (one ensuite) 4. Fully fitted kitchen 5. Private Rear Garden 6. Ample Parking 7. Highly sought-after location 8. 10 minutes' drive to Tallaght Hospital 9. 15 minutes' drive to The Square 10. 15 minutes' walk to Red Line LUAS 11. 15 minutes' walk to Citywest Shopping Centre 12. Ideal for a wide range of tenants 13. Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
